    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Kelly Hudson Properties proudly present this 3 bed semi detached property to the market.\n\nA beautifully presented three-bedroom semi-detached home situated in the popular Beechmount development in Newbridge. This attractive property offers well-proportioned accommodation throughout and is ideally suited to first-time buyers, families or those looking to upsize.\n\nThe property benefits from a newly fitted kitchen, providing a fresh and modern space for everyday living and entertaining. The main bedroom features the added convenience of a private ensuite, while new carpet on the stairs and landing adds to the property's fresh and well-maintained feel.\n\nExternally, the property enjoys side gate access to the rear garden, which is a particular feature of the home. The garden is well established and benefits from a selection of mature trees, creating a pleasant and private outdoor setting.\n\nLocated in Beechmount, the property is within easy reach of Newbridge town centre and its wide range of shops, schools, amenities and transport links, making this an excellent opportunity to acquire a comfortable family home in a convenient location.\n\nViewing of this property is highly recommended.\n\nACCOMMODATION:\n\nEntrance Hallway: Wooden flooring, alarm point\n\nKitchen/Dining: Tiled/wooden flooring, fully fitted kitchen, tiled splash back area, stainless steel sink, oven, hob, extractor fan, patio doors leading to garden area\n\nSitting Room: Wooden flooring, feature fireplace, feature bay window\n\nBedroom 1: Wooden flooring, fully fitted wardrobe\n\nEnsuite: Tiled floor, tiled surround, electric shower, WHB, WC\n\nBedroom 2: Wooden flooring, fully fitted wardrobe\n\nBedroom 3: Wooden flooring\n\nBathroom: Tiled flooring, tiled surround, bath with shower, WHB, WC\n\nFeatures:\n\nWired for alarm\nHardwood front door\nSelected carpets and light fittings included\nPVC double glazed windows\nOutside light\nSide gate access to rear garden\nNatural gas heating system\nMains water\nMains sewage\nBuilt in 1996\nc.82.3sqmt\n\nVIEWING IS STRICTLY BY APPOINTMENT ONLY.\n\nThe above particulars are issued by Kelly Hudson Properties on the understanding that all negotiations are conducted through them. Every care is taken in preparing particulars that are issued for guidance only and the firm do not hold themselves responsible for any inaccuracies."
      },
